 * Primary zero-transcode streaming audio extractor running inside a Web Worker:
 * - Reads only audio container headers & compressed packets lazily via BlobSource(file, { maxCacheSize: 4MB }).
 * - Never decodes video frames or re-encodes compatible audio (AAC/Opus/Vorbis/MP3/FLAC/PCM).
